      MaskType      "GridConverterControlSystem (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Current-vector grid-following control with a PLL in the power-control mode (GridConverterControlSystem with CurrentVectorController). Each class of motulator is a block with a mask of its arguments. The top-level blocks refer to the variables of the model initialization, and the blocks inside them get their parameters as in the constructors of motulator. T_s is the sampling period of the measurements. The input enable is the gate enable (ControlSystem.set_enable): while it is zero, the control system runs in standby for the blocked gates, computing its standby output, the feedback voltage being the measured converter voltage u_c_line, as in motulator."
